add('Shared odd-chip contract comment names the wrong starting position','S4','DOCS-CLAIMS','The implementation is correct; the type comment can mislead a future fixer.','CODE-NOW','packages/shared/src/poker.ts:33-34','packages/engine/src/pots.ts:100-128; claims check','/** Casino odd-chip rule: earliest position past the blinds. */','PotShare documents odd chips as earliest position past the blinds, whereas splitOddChips starts clockwise left of the dealer/button and skips to eligible winners.','A contributor following this contract literally could change a correct settlement rule. No wrong odd-chip payment was observed.','The shared type comment does not match the implemented and tested house rule.','Correct the comment to first eligible winner clockwise left of the button. Keep actual pot ordering unchanged and publish the same rule in house rules.','Reuse the existing pot-reference and odd-chip tests; do not add a test that merely mirrors a comment.','Shared comment, actual settlement and published house rule describe the same position; existing odd-chip tests still pass.','Documentation only; changing the engine ordering would introduce a regression.',"rg -n 'earliest position|left of the dealer|seatingOrderFromBlinds' packages/shared/src/poker.ts packages/engine/src/pots.ts; expected agreement; actual comment says past the blinds.");
